<title>UK: Bank Austria sets $100 mln five-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets $100 mln five-year bond. [CORRECTED 10:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Generale Bank and Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    22.AUG.02</p>
<p>(CORRECTS MATURITY DATE FROM 26.AUG.02)</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.585   PAY DATE    22.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.96     SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-5-10    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
